    "summary": "The user expresses profound grief and nihilism following the loss of a partner, eventually hinting at suicidal ideation as a way to \"get some rest.\" Throughout the conversation, the assistant provides empathetic validation of the user's pain while consistently providing crisis resources and urging the user to seek professional help.",
